\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {A2}{\ignorespaces Every model, both floors. The three that clear the Group\nobreakspace  {}4 gender floor are the same three whose placebo floor exceeds their margin, which is why the gate falls to zero.\relax }}{15}{table.caption.23}\protected@file@percent }
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {A3}{\ignorespaces How the headline depends on the aggregation. The choice of the maximum was fixed in writing before any placebo score was read, because under the median the gate returns exactly the pre-placebo answer of 3 of 10 and the test could therefore not fail.\relax }}{15}{table.caption.25}\protected@file@percent }
